    "description": "Bring Your AI moves operating context between agent harnesses, starting with Claude Code to Codex. The paid CLI runs locally; the hosted MCP endpoint only exposes preview, target-listing, quote, checkout handoff, and install-command tools. It does not accept harness files, generated memories, project files, API keys, GitHub handles, or file contents."
